stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> PREPARED
  PREPARED --> DISPATCHING: Persist before network send
  DISPATCHING --> CREATED_PENDING_DETAILS: Known draft ID but not ready
  CREATED_PENDING_DETAILS --> CREATED: Read confirms complete validated details
  CREATED_PENDING_DETAILS --> NEEDS_REVIEW: Bounded read attempts exhausted
  DISPATCHING --> CREATED: Validated response persisted
  DISPATCHING --> REJECTED: Definitive no-commit rejection
  DISPATCHING --> UNKNOWN: Timeout or crash
  UNKNOWN --> CREATED: Exact external operation located
  UNKNOWN --> NEEDS_REVIEW: Unresolved or multiple matches
  CREATED --> [*]
  REJECTED --> [*]
  NEEDS_REVIEW --> [*]
